"""Book 1 exercise content — the parts of a unit the spec does not carry.

AI drafts, like the dialogues, until Innes replaces them. Each unit:
  match      six word–meaning pairs for the vocabulary page
  thread     a short text with six numbered gaps, its bank and key
  form/use/watch  the three rule cards
  practice   six grammar items with keys
  gist       two questions on the dialogue, with answers
  controlled six communication items with keys
  roleA/B    the role cards
  script     the In the Room listening, as (speaker, line)
  listen     four questions on it, with answers
  mini       the one-minute role-play
  pron       the pronunciation note
  ref        the grammar reference entry
"""

